:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.23%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_NonConvertiblePromissoryNotesPayableMember_VAghwalhikyKGaQjZQPZ6A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="0" id="Tc_vX4ogDUJHUGu8rAFubrCrg_9_3">886,465</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.33%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.22%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_NonConvertiblePromissoryNotesPayableMember_1ouwGD-4bUCbQ5BZvKAjig" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="0" id="Tc_KMsg6vRx3kGbchK_UZg2Sg_9_6">856,258</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In May 2020, the Company formed a subsidiary in the Republic of Malta, Trust Stamp Malta Limited, with the intent to establish a research and development center with the assistance of potential grants and loans from the Maltese government. As part of the creation of this entity, we entered into an agreement with the government of Malta for a potentially repayable advance of up to &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_Fb8xPpyEcEq9VEhk-3BSaA" contextRef="As_Of_7_8_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_AKY8ybFowU2qlzW9FkG9Qg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_yk0nIoKuwk2v4hGcSrcchg">800</ix:nonFraction> thousand or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_7_8_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_AKY8ybFowU2qlzW9FkG9Qg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_21Kg8ewAkUOpTq_UiSBAhQ">858</ix:nonFraction> thousand to assist in covering the costs of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2020_To_5_1_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_RGHraxJbF0mHmaO6vD8_lw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:PercentageOfPayrollCostCoveredByAdvance" scale="-2" id="Narr_ofnnAnW2uEOe2Jshzh483Q">75</ix:nonFraction>% of the first <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_1_2020_To_5_1_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_RGHraxJbF0mHmaO6vD8_lw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="idai:TermOfPayrollCostsCoveredByAdvance" id="Narr_O56Vi1xHH0CpW2NbBXVbBw">24&#160;months</ix:nonNumeric> of payroll costs for any employee who begins <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_1_2020_To_5_1_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_RGHraxJbF0mHmaO6vD8_lw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="idai:EmploymentTermForReceivingAdvances" id="Narr_CYsqPRkWrkS6pXOhrR3BrQ">36&#160;months</ix:nonNumeric> from the execution of the agreement on July&#160;8, 2020. On February&#160;9, 2021, the Company began receiving funds and as of December&#160;31, 2021 the Company had received $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_blFxzgrRAkWK6oVdE8jlUw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ProceedsFromLoanFromMalteseGovernment" scale="3" id="Narr_TD8VZz4of0e-HLLzChpxEA">796</ix:nonFraction> thousand recorded to non-convertible notes payable. As of December 31, 2022, the balance received was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_PR57FJFL90eYweVqztOLDQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherComprehensiveIncomeLossForeignCurrencyTransactionAndTranslationAdjustmentNetOfTax" scale="3" id="Narr_w_QFgvlVzEaXKSvi_EpKfA">858</ix:nonFraction> thousand which includes changes in foreign currency rates and one additional loan receipt of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_PR57FJFL90eYweVqztOLDQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ProceedsFromAdditionalLoanFromMalteseGovernment" scale="3" id="Narr_HPAirGxMJUu9e5x1zA-IPQ">62</ix:nonFraction> thousand received during the year ended December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company will pay an annual interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2021_To_5_1_2021_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_-oUwY_c4ukiDs7AuUy0eVg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_gSKEdPqxr0S8HW8H8RRZZw">2</ix:nonFraction>% over the European Central Banks (ECB) base rate as set on the beginning of the&#160;year in review. If the ECB rate is below negative <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2021_To_5_1_2021_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_HN0HLXposECK2EfwrVJlEA" decimals="2" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="idai:MinimumVariableRateForInterestCalculation" scale="-2" id="Narr_4pD5aMyMlUuEyXa9PFkMBQ">one</ix:nonFraction>&#160;percent, the interest rate shall be fixed at <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_VPKTlKxMTk6SseAmbhlvnQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">one</span></span>&#160;percent. The Company will repay a minimum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2021_To_5_1_2021_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_1E5kMiBX20Wf4f8FmcK0Sg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:MinimumVariableRateForInterestCalculation" scale="-2" id="Narr_4_38Z2Oygk28lEPMlxB76w">10</ix:nonFraction>%&#160; of Trust Stamp Malta Limited&#8217;s pre-tax profits per annum capped at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2021_To_5_1_2021_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustStampMaltaLimitedMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_LoansFromMalteseGovernmentMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_EvxEGMmOuEi5SJ6iaxHgig" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:PercentageOfPreTaxProfitsPerAnnumToBeRepaid" scale="-2" id="Narr_8x3oh1BtKkSMCy3MEZn2qA">15</ix:nonFraction>% of the amount due to the Corporation until the disbursed funds are repaid. At this time, Trust Stamp Malta Limited does not have any revenue-generating contracts and therefore, we do not believe any amounts shall be classified as current.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-18</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">T STAMP INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_O_VmAaQFdUK0Qfxog_1XNw_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 22, 2020, the Company entered a promissory note for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_4_22_2020_To_4_22_2020_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_utDd7yLofUO-f5C3oP94tA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_GJowvzyo7kCKH4eYl52jTA">350,000</ix:nonFraction> with Second Century Ventures (&#8220;SCV&#8221;) in which the Company received net proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_4_22_2020_To_4_22_2020_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_utDd7yLofUO-f5C3oP94tA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfDebtAfterIssuanceCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_-Idndave4E6FMJxOViHqKA">345,000</ix:nonFraction>. Mark Birschbach, a director of the Company is the Managing Director of SCV. The unpaid principal, together with any then unpaid and accrued interest and any other amounts payable was due and payable on April 22, 2021 or in an event of default or a change in control as defined in the agreement and was repaid on time. The note accrued interest at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="As_Of_4_22_2020_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_9JpD29RP4Ee_XyAUQUl9eQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Za0D3qqjqk2Fvqf47llPbQ">8</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, compounded monthly. The outstanding principal of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_4_22_2021_To_4_22_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_sWzHbsH-_kO0QCphjlPcMA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfRelatedPartyDebt" scale="3" id="Narr_V2PrG6qjm0267IkAA2-tuw">350</ix:nonFraction> thousand and interest of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_4_22_2021_To_4_22_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_sWzHbsH-_kO0QCphjlPcMA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:InterestPaid" scale="3" id="Narr_w7kGAs73hU6v26vT38_EWQ">29</ix:nonFraction> thousand was paid off on April 22, 2021.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Concurrently with the issuance of the note on April 22, 2020, the Company entered into a warrant agreement to purchase shares of Class A Common Stock of the Company with SCV. Pursuant to the warrant agreement, the Company issued SCV a warrant to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_22_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_-ZFUtVuctUW96-Z-zdPnjw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_rHKI2_FoMk2DGR0S9xBSUw">15,000</ix:nonFraction> shares at a strike price of $<span style="background:#00ff00;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_22_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_-ZFUtVuctUW96-Z-zdPnjw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_X1Ib3fPD1kmkyVg45ZGUEA">0.01</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="background:#00ff00;"> </span>per share through April 22, 2021. At the expiration of the warrant agreement the warrants will be automatically exercised if the fair market value of the exercise shares exceeds the exercise price. If at any time during the term the fair market value of the exercise shares exceeds five times the exercise price, the Company shall provide SCV written notice and SCV may elect to exercise the warrant. If at any time during the term of the warrant agreement any portion of the shares of Class A Common Stock are converted to other securities, the warrants shall become immediately exercisable for that number of shares of the other securities that would have been received if the warrant agreement had been exercised in full prior to the conversion and the exercise price shall be adjusted. These warrants were exercised on April 22, 2021 at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_22_2021_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_idai_PromissoryNoteMember_isaDpfUsfkSspxgWeQdRMw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_W1Z7zFshaUeLX4jmF82f0Q">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_IKddgHnqLkGHIZqUje9Zaw_1_3"></a><a id="Tc_wAq2YmPbrUatnt2QP6Gn0w_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_9soeVA2Knk6tL8j1yKV0-A_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_9r7cZU3Fbkul-quIy5JDNQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_xlztjfYnykS7CdLlsuI6fw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_y3EadDXIKEiHyIGkIBhEDw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_DHYfUibZB0eR7WSpv2-AgQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_u_l47cifGkK9d_LLzOF3OA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_ngTe710sREiLUoctZlB9AA_6_3"></a><a id="Tc_i7WuqJP-PUGX2kfTFB93gw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_lvqLAR-bTU2vtMYmHntn4Q_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_jUTaEUP2fkue2u3yaGDexQ_8_2"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfStockholdersEquityNoteWarrantsOrRightsTextBlock" id="Tb_ytG-lnWrSUa3nEGQpQy6wA" continuedAt="Tb_ytG-lnWrSUa3nEGQpQy6wA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">4.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Warrants</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Liability Classified Warrants</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The following table presents the change in the liability balance associated with the liability-classified warrants, which are classified in Level 3 of the fair value hierarchy from January 1, 2021 to December 31, 2022:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_dNVeMnfGY0OGEE92RqiIJg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Warrants ($)</b></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Balance as of January 1, 2021</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_CULOpAtr0k-6Gy-qXct1VQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsFairValueOfShares" scale="0" id="Tc_C1PuaKciWEKJZ-Jau4xcSA_2_3">287,750</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Additional warrants issued</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_Bkk220RQ3kmrKrP8AdD9aA" decimals="0" format="ixt:zerodash" name="us-gaap:StockAndWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriodValuePreferredStockAndWarrants" scale="0" id="Tc_m8rKBe43c0uXoHG8iHGGmA_3_3">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Change in fair value</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_p_yJ6318hEacTE9-2zENoA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsImpactOfChangesInFairValueOfSharesOnAmounts" scale="0" id="Tc_QC0lrHHahE2yMBPGibB_gA_4_3">86,944</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt;">Balance as of December 31, 2021</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_pTX3pkuQK0CLOHuzM0ITrw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsFairValueOfShares" scale="0" id="Tc_upgXI7nBdEeN4QXG19LUhg_5_3">374,694</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Additional warrants issued</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> &#8212;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Change in fair value</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_Bkk220RQ3kmrKrP8AdD9aA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsImpactOfChangesInFairValueOfSharesOnAmounts" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_SfR6XaaVy0SGLL-Rl6MHjQ_7_3">113,125</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:84.97%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 6pt;">Balance as of December 31, 2022</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.69%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_FairValueByFairValueHierarchyLevelAxis_us-gaap_FairValueInputsLevel3Member_NI7w0NSC6kWcCqaMuB1FWw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsFairValueOfShares" scale="0" id="Tc_kGjGQvQBEkq7JihzogNh0Q_8_3">261,569</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2022, the Company has issued a customer a warrant to purchase up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="-4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:MaximumNumberOfWarrantsIssuedToPurchaseCommonStockInFuture" scale="6" id="Narr_lqGGFdU_W0Ss0-7HdycIVw">1.00</ix:nonFraction> million of capital stock in a future round of financing at a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_pIBmrbU8SU22zH7L2lRUkw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:PercentageOfDiscountOfFutureIssuanceOfPreferredStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ua0y2gUhU0K7bzTsXMpFEA">20</ix:nonFraction>% discount of the lowest price paid by another investor. The warrant was issued on November 9, 2016. There is no vesting period, and the warrant expires on November 30, 2026. The Company evaluated the provisions of ASC 480, Distinguishing Liabilities from Equity, noting the warrant should be classified as a liability due to its settlement being for a variable number of shares and potentially for a class of shares not yet authorized. The warrant was determined to have a fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_waYIbP9jREKzze5UAYX0SQ">250</ix:nonFraction> thousand which was recorded as a deferred contract acquisition asset and to a warrant liability during the year ended December 31, 2016 and was amortized as a revenue discount prior to the current periods presented. The fair value of the warrant was estimated on the date of grant by estimating the warrant&#8217;s intrinsic value on issuance using the estimated fair value of the Company as a whole and has a balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_JuW3IMuHr0-3DhKelsdNfA">250</ix:nonFraction> thousand as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 16, 2016, the Company issued an investor warrant to purchase $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_12_16_2016_To_12_16_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_Np4PRWajAUinf47YTCDFlA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_LB83tIfVkUK4_WjQ16FIKg">50</ix:nonFraction> thousand worth of shares of our Class A Shares of Common Stock. The warrants have <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_X1dQLcBbB0-YfI_PPb7knw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">no</span></span> vesting period and expires on December 16, 2026. The warrant agreement states that the investor is entitled to the &#8220;number of shares of Common Stock with a Fair Market Value as of the Determination Date of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_16_2016_zaq31zHcnEmGXDXC3Pjb_g" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_MyEB3U7miEm7geGWwlLFLA">50,000</ix:nonFraction>&#8221;. The determination date is defined as the &#8220;date that is the earlier of (A) the conversion of the investor&#8217;s Note into the equity interests of the Company or (B) the maturity date of the Note.&#8221; The investor converted the referenced Note on June 30, 2020, therefore, defining the determination date. The number of shares to be purchased is settled as <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2020_wi4eCTyIQEaiqPqPtJvKYg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_fjZ6RLFsRUqKximTAyA2WQ">6,418</ix:nonFraction> shares as of June 30, 2020. The exercise price of the warrants is variable until the exercise date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company used a Black-Scholes-Merton pricing model to determine the fair value of the warrants and uses this model to assess the fair value of the warrant liability. As of December 31, 2022, the warrant liability is recorded at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_FairValueOfWarrantLiabilityMember_lUKffye5HEWeD1WMCV_Gtg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionSettlementTermsFairValueOfShares" scale="3" id="Narr_qtoLoDhvuE-bTdzuK4LtTA">12</ix:nonFraction> thousand which is an $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_FairValueOfWarrantLiabilityMember_nI6hAqISNEmHFiACffofqA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_pkLDwvu0QkSqZHY8ZRPRZg">113</ix:nonFraction> thousand decrease, recorded to change in fair value of warrant liability, from the balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_FairValueOfWarrantLiabilityMember_lFYwomiReUKJ8Qe_k37XXA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_HdkR3tQ8_UGl_HEgZUlxzA">125</ix:nonFraction> thousand as of December 31, 2021.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-19</p></div></div>
