ls="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Tc_WlCNwIFRdkWGafJhlDgKjg_10_5">1,465,083</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.86%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.53%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_YceR4Z-DIEaorwFwm7Gjuw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Tc_4KkyRdDEuk-wL6Yb9Z6BWw_10_7">1,550,402</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 30, 2016, the Company issued REach&#174;, a related party, a warrant to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_OvowTogiCEe0Lh3N4fIGlA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_L8MYZdwZkUy96mtD7a28eQ">80,128</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A Shares of Common Stock with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2016_To_9_30_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_LeUVjtEDE0qH2GnuEGteLg" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_ijtYmH6PskKdz_Ze828CPg">0.8320</ix:nonFraction> per share. There is <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_LCpkIea7AkGdpvqLeSoRiQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">no</span></span> vesting period, and the warrant expires on September 30, 2026. The fair value of the warrant was estimated on the date of grant using the Black-Scholes-Merton model.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 21, 2021, REach&#174; executed a Notice of Exercise for its warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_21_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_uJQZwQfd2U-x9JMq5sFlCQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_vRsFayBWCUiWJ9nQNT_F_g">80,128</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A Common Stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_21_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_uJQZwQfd2U-x9JMq5sFlCQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_vZEPmsGkHkOivNRywuyJLA">0.8320</ix:nonFraction> per share. The closing occurred on January 10, 2022 and resulted in total cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_12_21_2021_To_12_21_2021__h6GbBUiTEqAburDanJj2g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_2_Kz46hDGkmQNOMmtDJ3yA">67</ix:nonFraction> thousand to the Company for the warrant exercise.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company has issued a customer a warrant to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_9_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_8fxZt3HXHUWxDupyrQz2RQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_p5l_aFGJokqAXmiPghpySw">80,128</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class&#160;A Shares of Common Stock with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_9_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_8fxZt3HXHUWxDupyrQz2RQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_hUiVnA92_EC6jlbWzliOtA">3.1200</ix:nonFraction> per share. The warrant was issued on November&#160;9, 2016. There is <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_TSHHIhoV0EWk1yz0DCYAqg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">no</span></span> vesting period, and the warrant expires on November 30, 2026. The Company used a Black-Scholes-Merton pricing model to determine the fair value of the warrant. The fair value of the warrant issued in connection with the customer contract was determined to be $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="Duration_11_9_2016_To_11_9_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_1qnPmm-0YkOve-vEamSWuQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:FairValueOfWarrantsPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_djzlVctvC0aQ0Eq6rqMzPg">2.30</ix:nonFraction> per share and had a fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2016_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_yhDMgNJh8UWLJZSexgfy4Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_fXhUxZJByEWCJO86V5Xnrw">183</ix:nonFraction> thousand which was recorded as a deferred contract acquisition asset and to additional paid-in capital during the&#160;year ended December&#160;31, 2016 and which was amortized as a revenue discount in the periods prior to those presented. The fair value of the warrant issued is recorded as a revenue discount as it is considered a sales incentive.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">These warrants remain outstanding as of December&#160;31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In January 2020, the Company issued REach&#174;, a related party, a warrant to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_31_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustedMailMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_zjOASlgCLUu0pbMqaiCJmA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_ZM6lmagfXUCvYxUy3kjRXQ">186,442</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s Class&#160;A Shares of Common Stock at an exercise of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_31_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustedMailMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_zjOASlgCLUu0pbMqaiCJmA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_55ItpW0Hx0W2LbTiyfRfTA">8.0000</ix:nonFraction> per share in exchange for the cancellation of a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustedMailMember_QxBGM5PDM0S3UVVsRCWjNQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:CancellationOfSharesValueIssuedToInvestor" scale="3" id="Narr_Z-gBhL5MikabT7IO35Xl8A">100</ix:nonFraction> thousand SAFE issued on August&#160;18, 2017 by the Company&#8217;s affiliate Trusted Mail&#160;Inc. with a value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_idai_TrustedMailMember_QxBGM5PDM0S3UVVsRCWjNQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ExchangeOfSafesForWarrants" sign="-" scale="3" id="Narr_gQIRrQaKFkWnboNRMvd88Q">125</ix:nonFraction> thousand. The warrants were issued on January&#160;23, 2020. There is <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_1-NuYo6T40iHrDdVzQjuRw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">no</span></span> vesting period, and the warrants expire on December&#160;20, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">These warrants remain outstanding as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In January 2020, the Company issued SCV, a related party, a warrant to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_31_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_i_sl24f4nE2EBEQYaYmvtQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_MLqDIZi3Sk-AJtw6ttdULw">932,111</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s Class A Common Stock at a strike price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_hOQIwhdg-0mywNkI-toRxA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:WarrantsStrikePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_HcetNRTpIUGP9mzBVdtDfg">8.0000</ix:nonFraction> per share in exchange for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_sgpBtIQfCEiiXOz2zVcHQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:FairValueOfConsiderationReceivedFromWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_My8zjV8eX0WkdY1GmMkpiQ">300</ix:nonFraction> thousand in cash and &#8220;Premium&#8221; sponsorship status with a credited value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_sgpBtIQfCEiiXOz2zVcHQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:WarrantsValueCreditedPerAnnumOverThreeYearsPeriod" scale="3" id="Narr_DzBBWQLMP0GN7XejM4Miig">100</ix:nonFraction> thousand per&#160;year for 3&#160;years totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_1_31_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_sgpBtIQfCEiiXOz2zVcHQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:FairValueOfConsiderationReceivedFromWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_LkxwXJe8YE2UZXiLYGXTcQ">300</ix:nonFraction> thousand. This &#8220;premium&#8221; sponsorship status provides the Company with certain benefits in marketing and networking, such as the Company being listed on the investor&#8217;s website, as well as providing the Company certain other promotional opportunities organized by the investor. The warrants were issued on January&#160;23, 2020. There is <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_DFRHhikC-ky4RggqRPfZWQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">no</span></span> vesting period, and the warrants expire on December&#160;20, 2024.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-20</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">T STAMP INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_ytG-lnWrSUa3nEGQpQy6wA_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 21, 2021, SCV executed a Notice of Exercise for certain of its warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_21_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_idai_WarrantPurchaseAgreementMember_yi1JrtHIe0-_TXrOBVlvVg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_ET9VntHKIkuYSRCbdw9t8Q">407,512</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A Common Stock at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_21_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_idai_WarrantPurchaseAgreementMember_yi1JrtHIe0-_TXrOBVlvVg" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_UtnrWQcDDkGpEw4NZ4JdtA">8.0000</ix:nonFraction> per share for a total purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_12_21_2021_To_12_21_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_idai_WarrantPurchaseAgreementMember_scgAZdWH9EWwGgAjE_JTxQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="6" id="Narr_tbns4NYYP0eR53M6I97nwg">3.26</ix:nonFraction> million. The closing occurred on January 10, 2022 and resulted in total cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_12_21_2021_To_12_21_2021_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_idai_SecondCenturyVenturesLlcMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_idai_WarrantPurchaseAgreementMember_scgAZdWH9EWwGgAjE_JTxQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="6" id="Narr_9XE0SXufJUqdXnSCX5jP8A">3.26</ix:nonFraction> million to the Company for the warrant exercise.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The warrants to purchase the remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_R4oLDuSf-0mX9GnPevuIbw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_GPe4u_blH0G2itXhK_rkAg">524,599</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s Class A Shares of Common Stock remain outstanding as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_idai_RegulationCfDAndSCommonStockAndWarrantOfferingMember_dlNWfYZb_Uum1xL5jsELAA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_2gwM1esTBU2oYZ8C3YPdRw">271,593</ix:nonFraction> warrants from August 2021 to December 2021 and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_28_2022_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_idai_RegulationCfDAndSCommonStockAndWarrantOfferingMember_nzhEplDqQ0ut78TvAZ06pA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_OQ3HfS1t4UWhrVpOJ4arAw">15,421</ix:nonFraction> warrants from January 2022 to February 2022 related to the Regulation CF, D, and S common stock and warrant offering. These warrants became exercisable on January 26, 2022 when the Company received SEC qualification of its offering statement on Form 1-A. These warrants expire as of the earlier of: (a) January 26, 2023, (b) the acquisition of the Company by another entity, or (c) immediately prior to the closing of a firm commitment underwritten public offering. On August 25, 2022, we refunded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_8_25_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_CfCommonStockMember_9GqQbG7800Ki1FYDMhYIgg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ValueOfUnitsRefunded" scale="0" id="Narr_FI_K5gBuDkq43_NJWYFd2Q">5,000</ix:nonFraction> in Regulation CF Units to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_EB8Zc7EXbEejYSHRVGbJsQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_25_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_CfCommonStockMember_9GqQbG7800Ki1FYDMhYIgg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="idai:NumberOfInvestorsToWhomUnitsRefunded" scale="0" id="Narr_l8E4Q_TzlEmx8O7Bz3mwYg">two</ix:nonFraction> investors resulting in the cancellation of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_8_25_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_idai_CfCommonStockMember_9GqQbG7800Ki1FYDMhYIgg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:NumberOfWarrantsCancelled" scale="0" id="Narr_ktKnqrabHkyXId3eSL7SXA">250</ix:nonFraction> warrants. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the year ended December 31, 2022, investors exercised <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_idai_InvestorsExercisedMember_4keynALj6ESsDANTA8mlvQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_Z7k_W0UdOU-VcElFf8eing">2,850</ix:nonFraction> warrants at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_idai_InvestorsExercisedMember_4keynALj6ESsDANTA8mlvQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_saRZ96780kG-srBcZ6I65A">20.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, resulting in total cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_idai_InvestorsExercisedMember_aBtftOovrUi7cXPa7rFCYw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="3" id="Narr_eb047B_N0UicBrKbUIH8qg">57</ix:nonFraction> thousand to the Company for the warrant exercises. The warrants to purchase the remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_idai_InvestorsExercisedMember_4keynALj6ESsDANTA8mlvQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ClassOfWarrantToPurchase" scale="0" id="Narr_eJLNv48H-0i9iRlOG9xFAg">283,914</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s Class A Shares of Common Stock remain outstanding as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 11, 2022, the Company entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;SPA&#8221;) with Armistice Capital Master Fund Ltd. Pursuant to the terms of the SPA, the Company agreed, at the closing of the SPA, to sell and issue to the Armistice Capital Master Fund Ltd. in a private placement <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_11_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_idai_SecuritiesPurchaseAgreementWithArmisticeCapitalMasterFundLtd.Member_cZc-LuqpfU2zgHNMb7gXgA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_ZwFpNJx6eUim3Xp_7R3Bhg">195,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A Common Stock of the Company and warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_11_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_JL3aPR6EsEOMaWvdYZ-FaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_i8AvRrt8d0qHOT7GK2ntfQ">390,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A Common Stock of the Company for a total purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_9_11_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_JL3aPR6EsEOMaWvdYZ-FaQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:MaximumNumberOfWarrantsIssuedToPurchaseCommonStockInFuture" scale="0" id="Narr_uwZPtCtIeUyndIQA0DQ2KA">1,511,250</ix:nonFraction>. The Company incurred offering costs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_9_11_2022_To_9_11_2022_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_55IGyleQWkWhf3XmqCvz0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" scale="0" id="Narr_Nx1XqPauIECxZP7u5JHRew">90,675</ix:nonFraction> from this transaction that were recorded as a reduction of the gross proceeds.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The warrants also allow for a &#8220;cashless exercise&#8221; if, at any time after the six (<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_y-9_6rb9zEKg_M3X3PPbMQ" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="idai:ThresholdPeriodAfterWhichCashlessExerciseOfWarrants" id="Narr_unC-OYnwT0uVTPHkjj1adQ">6</ix:nonNumeric>) month anniversary of the issue date of the warrants there is no effective registration statement registering the resale of the Class A Common Stock issuable pursuant to the warrants. In such a case, then warrants may also be exercised, in whole or in part, by means of a cashless exercise in which the Selling Stockholder will be entitled to receive a number of shares of Class A Common Stock as described in the warrants. Trust Stamp filed the registration statement on September 30, 2022 and received the notice of effectiveness on January 26, 2023. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_cXLxJvRRDkWlxcbKMcnZ3w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:NumberOfWarrantsCancelled" scale="0" id="Narr_IX_OTVZOIk2nsg8FqWIdxw">390,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants have an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_cXLxJvRRDkWlxcbKMcnZ3w" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_1BTnEvtfx0yVqrOQJNgkfw">8.85</ix:nonFraction> and may be exercised at any time by the Selling Stockholder starting on the issuance date, September 14, 2022, until the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_9_14_2022_cXLxJvRRDkWlxcbKMcnZ3w" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" id="Narr_TcR56ZScPUCFy0nJeETO_w">five year</ix:nonNumeric> and six-month anniversary thereafter.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">These warrants remain outstanding as of December 31, 2022.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_BsIYfuELAEy-YgjCZu3Lnw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_A8eNmfYwCUGNidDf2F1t5A_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_qa6peiHCK0OMD_gqz_cZrQ_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_uKAMZwSZ3UOjze9OPqDRng_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_C3of490Sd0KC8WjWdjwGLQ_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_NGdhkUqifkKO53nJLeG3xQ_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_adUizq_Kh0SN463CaOPqCg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_W3kny26aA0OZxgNe58ExMQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_cijsrl19LE-G_iQZR7iIyA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_7BN4atol_0Kzb14vYVhu3A_6_3"></a><a id="Tc_S5wjAjdr9k-MkSyDmwjdpg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_Q0q2o7dh9EO5Uj1xTtfcJQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_t7m5OqQtuE2Hu6d2Zjn2fQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_SfFBOi-KzESI3VOQCUYqgg_9_2"></a><a id="Tc_qKTKxJN_50qkqydQF6XDqA_9_5"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:SupplementalBalanceSheetDisclosuresTextBlock" id="Tb_4erJSbqUUUaBQkixRyGp1A" continuedAt="Tb_4erJSbqUUUaBQkixRyGp1A_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family