zd1dD8fQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_i_Tu-PKiTkuFLQjrJzmKWQ_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_mxKEvBd3OkOy-QdRm9V2yg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_E9F8uJwLIkeMoOx_4ogu0w_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_ymxo5WQUI0Gt4ZBfxRPHtg_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_AgsAx5eVvU2OpGV5NdEpiA_7_5"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock" id="Tb_CUVQO2x910SpKJXZYYMoUw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">7.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Revenue Recognition</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Remaining Performance Obligations</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s arrangements with its customers often have terms that span over multiple&#160;years. However, the Company generally allows its customers to terminate contracts for convenience prior to the end of the stated term with less than twelve&#160;months&#8217; notice. Revenue allocated to remaining performance obligations represents noncancelable contracted revenue that has not yet been recognized, which includes deferred revenue and, in certain instances, amounts that will be invoiced. The Company has elected the practical expedient allowing the Company to not disclose remaining performance obligations for contracts with original terms of twelve&#160;months or less. Cancelable contracted revenue, which includes customer deposit liabilities, is not considered a remaining performance obligation. As of December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021 the Company does not have any related performance obligations for contracts with terms exceeding twelve&#160;months.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Disaggregation of Revenue</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:DisaggregationOfRevenueTableTextBlock" id="Tb_AbQvXmAqR0STuCkuIroGUA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:74.81%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.36%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.5%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:8.72%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.36%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.5%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td st