1.03%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.55%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExercisableIntrinsicValue1" scale="0" id="Tc_zyvo35F3VUejntedscXtiA_15_11">0</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The aggregate intrinsic value of options outstanding, exercisable, and vested and exercisable is calculated as the difference between the exercise price of the underlying options and the fair value of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The aggregate intrinsic value of options exercised during the year ended December 31, 2022 and 2021 is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_YceR4Z-DIEaorwFwm7Gjuw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableIntrinsicValue1" scale="3" id="Narr_1fWWBUSQ_k20iWBbDZv3Eg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableIntrinsicValue1" scale="3" id="Narr_zreNpgUXnkWJ_oRvB7EbGQ">0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The weighted average grant-date fair value of options granted during the years ended December 31, 2022, and 2021 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_WE9UteLLuUSQ2fXmDqcgzw">7.65</ix:nonFraction> and $ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_aBWaYraXY0mTspXt6J7DNQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_n0CoLI8auEiEQo_pc0reEQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_Fhe6V9RapEyLX0phnQJ_Ug">9.55</ix:nonFraction> per share, respectively. The total grant-date fair value of options that vested during the years ended December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_Zro0LrIR70GtZtvF_W8x7A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValueOfOptionsGrantedAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_eqm8xTDj_0u8ss_HTSGdQw">57</ix:nonFraction> thousand and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_YceR4Z-DIEaorwFwm7Gjuw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValueOfOptionsGrantedAmount" scale="3" id="Narr_vm6T-HA56EqMKnAr6SMsbg">500</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2022, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_33Gl2hkGBEeW4vYozSNCQg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_nZkV44A7W06YBzxRJQ_UXQ">387,109</ix:nonFraction> stock options outstanding of which all are fully vested options. As of December 31, 2022, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_33Gl2hkGBEeW4vYozSNCQg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_Nyn6v8qb8kutKO4ZNHGezw">64,699</ix:nonFraction> common stock grants outstanding of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_33Gl2hkGBEeW4vYozSNCQg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_IlYrPUlA4keCqUjWPWlJzQ">57,197</ix:nonFraction> were vested but not issued and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_J-yUhg49O06Yo_IRD7aEeg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:StockGrantedButNotYetVested" scale="0" id="Narr_uCM6vU1EQUSX8GfLQLvWfw">7,502</ix:nonFraction> were not yet vested. All granted and outstanding common stock grants will fully vest by August 31, 2023. The Company had unrecognized stock-based compensation related to common stock grants of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_J-yUhg49O06Yo_IRD7aEeg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:UnrecognizedStockCompensationRelatedToStock" scale="3" id="Narr_gBdfMtcnWECK_RnhkVIJ7w">23</ix:nonFraction> thousand as of December 31, 2022. As of December 31, 2022, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_k-xTS2EzBUWpU6tXM_NTaA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_LpKEX96VpUK0Fgg07XPmGg">292,565</ix:nonFraction> RSUs outstanding of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_k-xTS2EzBUWpU6tXM_NTaA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_yM-U3KSF5Ua3FoAM7XLjyw">44,234</ix:nonFraction> were vested but not issued and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pyJnJOmTQkKCUCOABRlhwQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_78d33s7oG0yo-dEupAaoXA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:RestrictedStockUnitsRsusGrantedButNotYetVested" scale="0" id="Narr_-sPRdT8uPEaJ2oR06AZHJA">248,331</ix:nonFraction> were not yet vested. All granted and outstanding RSUs will fully vest by January 2, 2024. The Company had unrecognized stock-based compensation related to RSUs of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lQZOO5SlnUSXzPqjRQyH6g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_78d33s7oG0yo-dEupAaoXA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="idai:UnrecognizedStockCompensationRelatedToRsus" scale="3" id="Narr_w75XdYbPqUCXgRh1oAS5HA">176</ix:nonFraction> thousand as of December 31, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">A summary of outstanding RSU activity is as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_QWt29l1ZlUe-RUzoAGoBfQ" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedCompensationRestrictedStockUnitsAwardActivityTableTextBlock" id="Tb_7ORrPnZnTkOHYgvjXLNBJQ" continuedAt="Tb_7ORrPnZnTkOHYgvjXLNBJQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:80%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.76%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.31%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:28.92%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><sp